        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Batabani ba Daudi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banu nubo batabani ba Daudi aba yazaaliire Hebburooni: Omuzigaijo nuwe Amunooni, ogu akamuzaaraho Ahinohamu Omunyayezereerikati; omusubiro, nuwe Danyeri, ogu akamuzaaraho Abigairi Omukarumeerikati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa kasatu, nuwe Abusalomu, nyina nuwe Maaka muhara wa Talumayi omukama wa Gesura; owa kana nuwe Adoniya, nyina nuwe Hagisi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "owa kataano, nuwe Sefatiya, ou yazaireho Abitaali; owa mukaaga nuwe Iseryamu, ou yazaireho mukazi we Egura; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 5:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.5.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.2.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakam 2:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Byok 29:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukaaga abo, akabazarra Hebburooni, nambere yalemere okumara emyaka musanju n'ameezi mukaaga. Kandi Yerusaalemu, akagiremera emyaka makumi asatu n'esatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.11.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 11:3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banu nubo yazaaliire Yerusaalemu: Simeya, Sobbabbu, Nasani na Solomooni, abbana abo, akabazaaraho Batisuwa muhara w'Amyeri; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hanyuma yazaara: Ibbuhaara, Erisaama, Erifereti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nooga, Nefegi, Yafiya, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erishama, Eryada, n'Erifereti, boona hamu mwenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abo boona, nubo batabani ba Daudi otabaliiremu abayazaireho bakazi be aba harubaju; munyanyabo, yayetwaga Tamara.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oruzaaro rw'Omukama Solomooni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Runu nurwo oruzaaro rwa Solomooni: Rehobbowamu, omutabani Abiya, ogu, nuwe yazaire Asa. Kandi onu, nuwe yazaire Yehosofaati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ise Yehoraamu; Yehoraamu ogu, nuwe yazaire Ahaziya, kizaara Yowaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi mutabani wa Yowaasi ogu Amaziya, nuwe yazaire Amaziya, mutabani w'Azaliya Yosaamu, akongera yazaara, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahazi ise Hezekiya kizaara Manaase. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi Manaase, akazaara Amooni ise Yosiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banu nubo batabani ba Yosiya: Omuzigaijo Yohanaani, omusubiro Yehoyakimu, owa kasatu nuwe Zedaliya, owa kana Saluumu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banu nubo baijukuru ba Yehoyakimu: Yekoniya na Zedekiya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi banu nubo batabani ba Yekoniya omunyagwa: Seyarutyeri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malikiramu, Pedaaya, Senaza, Yekamiya, Hosama na Nedabiya; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "banu nubo batabani ba Pedaaya: Zerubbabberi na Simeyi; batabani ba Zerubbabberi: Mesuraamu na Hananiya, kandi Seromiisi akaba ali munyaanya bo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nukwo oteho Hasubba, Oheri, Bberekiya, Hasadiya na Yusabbu-hesedi, boona hamu bataano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi batabani ba Hananiya, nubo banu; Paratiya na Yesaaya kizaara Rrefaaya; kandi mutabani w'ogu, nuwe: Arunani kizaara Obadiya ayazaire Sekaniya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutabani wa Sekaniya nuwe Semaya, kizaara: Hatusi, Igali, Baliya, Nuyaliya na Safati, boona hamu mukaaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banu nubo batabani ba Neyaliya: Eliyo-henayi, Hizukiya, n'Azulikaamu, boona hamu basatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Banu nubo batabani b'Eliyo-henayi: Hodaviya, Eryasibbu, Pelaaya, Akubbu, Yohanaani, Delaaya na Anani, boona hamu musanju.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
